        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion BD-F8, Venetian Lever With Olde World Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEvery inch of this Fusion made Venetian Lever with Olde World Rose is adorned with ornate detailing. From the embossed lever tip to the textured rose, this gorgeous leverset is dripping in elegance. Made out of solid brass, it is available in oil rubbed bronze, brushed nickel, antique copper, and antique pewter finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. From rose to tip, this elaborately decorated lever and rose set radiates the attention to detail one might expect to see on the even most beautiful buildings of antiquity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion BD-F8 Ornate Venetian Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Old World Door Lever Fusion BD F8:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Old World Venetian Lever and Rose, Fusion BD-F8",
                "description": "Venetian Lever With Olde World Rose Fusion BD-F8 - Every inch of this Fusion made Venetian Lever with Olde World Rose is adorned with ornate detailing. From the embossed lever tip to the textured rose, this gorgeous leverset is dripping in elegance. Made out of solid brass, it is available in oil rubbed bronze, brushed nickel, antique copper, and antique pewter finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. From rose to tip, this elaborately decorated lever and rose set radiates the attention to detail one might expect to see on the even most beautiful buildings of antiquity.\r\n",
